  "description": "Non-material amendment to planning permission reference: 2024/02489/FUL dated 9th January 2025 for the \"Erection of a front dormer roof extension; replacement of all existing white uPVC windows and doors with white aluminium triple-glazed windows and doors; installation of timber door to replace existing door to front elevation at lower ground floor level; raising of level of built-up rear garden to be 400mm below existing patio; installation of a glazed balustrade above existing brick wall around existing rear garden; and installation of a retractable awning to the existing rear roof terrace.\"  Amendment sought is to revise the configuration of the window within the front elevation of the previously approved dormer. The approved single window comprising three panes is to be divided into two separate windows, one comprising a single pane and the other comprising two panes, with a solid vertical section between them to accommodate an internal stud partition. The overall window opening, dimensions and position will remain as approved, with no increase to the approved glazing area or any changes to the dormer structure or external dimensions. ",
